tokens). Nearly all of its large activations are on tokens that name clouds, and it
is nearly a pure function of the current token, so a word list captures most of it.
The per-token average would explain about 0.8 of the variance; this small rule
explains about 0.41, because the remaining variance is spread thinly over many
common tokens (" of", " to", "�") with tiny, context-dependent values.
